{"slug":"Broom-Training-It-might-be-OP-37985","_id":"680f861761a6eae7fab0d29e","title":"Get wins for free","game":{"_id":"680f4661219af807bfec6f01","gameId":120570155878200,"name":"[UPD] Broom Training","imageUrl":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/no-game.webp","original":null},"thumbnail":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/no-game.webp","original":null},"placeId":120570155878200},"features":"Get a ton of wins in just a few seconds\n\nP.S You don't need to get key, because it's open source\n\nOnly tested on Hydrogen-M (MacOS), I can't test it with windows\\android executors.\n\nDiscord: baksff | DM Me if you have any problems with script.","tags":[],"script":"repeat task.wait() until game:IsLoaded()\n\n--// some check\nif not getgenv then return print(\"Your executor doesn't support the `getgenv` function\") end\n\n--// getgenv\ngetgenv().autowins = false -- true = work | false = not work\ngetgenv().loopdelay = .3 -- delay for while loop\n\n--// Services\nlocal ReplicatedStorage = game:GetService(\"ReplicatedStorage\")\n\n--// Variables\nlocal GameEvent = ReplicatedStorage.Event.RemoteEvent.CToS.Game\n\n--// Functions\nlocal function autoFarmWins()\n    GameEvent.CStartRace:FireServer()\n    task.wait()\n    GameEvent.CGiveUpRace:FireServer()\n\n    for i = 1, 16 do\n        GameEvent.CGetRaceWins:FireServer(string.format(\"Wins_%d\", i), 0)\n    end\nend\n\nwhile autowins do task.wait(loopdelay)\n    autoFarmWins()\nend","owner":{"_id":"622cee03d7b48fb0b551e480","username":"Noctyde","verified":true,"profilePicture":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/47e84b4275953468184a4e1054a9cdbee37a4c42134ad4fa859286cfd10a0c35.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/photo/622cee03d7b48fb0b551e480-1746063268373.png"},"status":"offline","id":"622cee03d7b48fb0b551e480","topMilestone":{"key":"creator.first_script","tier":1},"profile":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/47e84b4275953468184a4e1054a9cdbee37a4c42134ad4fa859286cfd10a0c35.webp","original":"https://scriptbl